  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ravinder Sharma vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 24 October, 2025 Aphc010566872025 In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh At Amaravati [3396] (Special Original Jurisdiction) Friday,The Twenty Fourth Day Of October Two Thousand And Twenty Five Present The Honourable Dr Justice Venkata Jyothirmai Pratapa Writ Petition No: 29332/2025 Between: 1. Ravinder Sharma, S/O Mahinder Sharma, Aged About 64 Years, R/O H.No 74, Road No -220 Ward No -1, Housing Board Colony, Baldev Nagar, Ambala City, Punjab ...Petitioner And 1. The State Of Andhra Pradesh, Rep. By Its Pri. Secretary, Home Department, Ap Secretariat, Velagapudi, Amaravathi, Guntur District. 2. The Special Investigation Team, Sit Office. Old Scbc Building, Opp Balaji Link Bus Stand, Alipiri, Tirupathi. 3. The Director General Of Police, Dgp Office, Mangalagiri, Guntur District. 4. The Director, Central Bureau Of Investigation, 15-B, Cgo Complex, Lodhi Road. New Delhi - 110003. 5. The Superintendent Of Police, Tirupathi, Tirupathi District. 6. The Additional Superintendent Of Police Admin, Special Investigation Team, Tirupathi. 7. The Station House Officer, East Ps, Tirupathi. 8. J Venkat Rao, Occ Investigation Officer, Special Investigation Team, Old Svbc Building Alipir, Tirupati - 517501. ...Respondent(S): Counsel for the Petitioner: 1. Sivaprasad Reddy Venati Counsel for the Respondent(S): 1. Gp For Home The Court made the following: 2 The Honourable Dr Justice Venkata Jyothirmai Pratapa Writ Petition No: 29332/2025 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned Senior Counsel would submit that the petitioner is Lab In- charge of M/s Bhole Baba Organic Dairy Milk Private Limited, Bhagwanpur and he was arrayed as Accused No.23 in Crime No.470 of 2024 of East Police Station, Tirupati, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 274, 275, 316(5), 318(3), 318(4), 61(2), 299, 336(3), 340(2) r/w 49 and 3(5) of BNS and Section 51 & 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act. Learned Senior Counsel would further submit that Investigating Agency has completed the investigation and filed charge sheet and now the petitioner was issued notice to appear before the Investigating Officer without any reasonable grounds. 4. Learned Special Public Prosecutor for CBI would submit that the presence of the petitioner is necessary for further examination and hence, he was issued notice to appear before the SIT.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned Senior Counsel would submit that the petitioner is Lab In- charge of M/s Bhole Baba Organic Dairy Milk Private Limited, Bhagwanpur and he was arrayed as Accused No.23 in Crime No.470 of 2024 of East Police Station, Tirupati, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 274, 275, 316(5), 318(3), 318(4), 61(2), 299, 336(3), 340(2) r/w 49 and 3(5) of BNS and Section 51 & 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act. Learned Senior Counsel would further submit that Investigating Agency has completed the investigation and filed charge sheet and now the petitioner was issued notice to appear before the Investigating Officer without any reasonable grounds. 4. Learned Special Public Prosecutor for CBI would submit that the presence of the petitioner is necessary for further examination and hence, he was issued notice to appear before the SIT.",
